mintcam (0.3.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Regenerate the promotional banners from scripts/make-banner.py so their
    content cannot drift from the application again. The old images still
    advertised PySide6 after the port to PyQt6, and the version was hardcoded
    in a raster file, so every change meant editing pixels by hand.
  * The banners now show PyQt6 and the current version, and are reproducible.

